","people_xingming":"刘馀","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee645-db0e-11ef-b36b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-168,"link_death_year":-128,"link_td_description":"刘非，汉景帝与程姬的儿子，汉武帝的同父异母兄弟，程姬有三子刘余、刘非、刘端，他是第二子。汉景帝前二年（前155年）立为汝南王。七国之乱后，改封为江都王（在位27年）。刘非的儿子刘建后来继承了江都王的爵位，生了远嫁乌孙的细君公主。他的陵墓位于今日江苏省淮安市盱眙县。","link_td_id":"Q10008599","link_td_number_id":341897,"people_name":"非","people_name_jianti_auto":"非","people_xingming":"刘非","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee646-db0e-11ef-ab48-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-168,"link_death_year":-128,"link_td_description":"刘非，汉景帝与程姬的儿子，汉武帝的同父异母兄弟，程姬有三子刘余、刘非、刘端，他是第二子。汉景帝前二年（前155年）立为汝南王。七国之乱后，改封为江都王（在位27年）。刘非的儿子刘建后来继承了江都王的爵位，生了远嫁乌孙的细君公主。他的陵墓位于今日江苏省淮安市盱眙县。","link_td_id":"Q10008599","link_td_number_id":341897,"people_name":"汝南王","people_name_jianti_auto":"汝南王","people_xingming":"刘非","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee647-db0e-11ef-bf3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-92,"link_td_description":"刘彭祖，西汉景帝第八子，贾夫人所生。","link_td_id":"Q10004427","link_td_number_id":1295996,"people_name":"彭祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"彭祖","people_xingming":"刘彭祖","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee648-db0e-11ef-9c8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-92,"link_td_description":"刘彭祖，西汉景帝第八子，贾夫人所生。","link_td_id":"Q10004427","link_td_number_id":1295996,"people_name":"廣川王","people_name_jianti_auto":"广川王","people_xingming":"刘彭祖","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee649-db0e-11ef-887d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"發","people_name_jianti_auto":"发","people_xingming":"刘发","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee64a-db0e-11ef-801a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"長沙王","people_name_jianti_auto":"长沙王","people_xingming":"刘发","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee64b-db0e-11ef-ac4d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、长沙府（卷八十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。后汉复为长沙郡。汉末属蜀，后属吴，仍为长沙郡。晋因之...","context_before":"...汉为长沙国[高帝初，吴芮为长沙王，都临湘，传五世，国除。","source_end_index":128,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f0ae00cb-b689-544f-b68e-07bc748821f1","source_start_index":115,"source_text":"景帝封子发为长沙王，国于此"}],"path":"湖广方舆纪要/十、长沙府（卷八十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3春，三月，甲寅，立皇子德爲河間王，閼爲臨江王，餘爲淮陽王，非爲汝南王，彭祖爲廣川王，發爲長沙王。","content_fanyi":"春季三月甲寅日，景帝册封皇子刘德为河间王，册封皇子刘阏为临江王，册封皇子刘馀为淮阳王，册封皇子刘非为汝南王，册封皇子刘彭祖为广川王，册封皇子刘发为长沙王。","content_jianti_auto":"3春，三月，甲寅，立皇子德为河间王，阏为临江王，余为淮阳王，非为汝南王，彭祖为广川王，发为长沙王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1232,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee632-db0e-11ef-a8be-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薄太皇","people_name_jianti_auto":"薄太皇","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee64e-db0e-11ef-8809-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee64f-db0e-11ef-a54b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"薄太皇，文帝母也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"薄太皇，文帝母也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee64d-db0e-11ef-9863-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"皇室尊号","official_name":"太皇太后","official_note":"太皇太后是皇帝的祖母或曾祖母的尊号，此处指汉景帝的祖母薄氏去世，在《资治通鉴》中用于记录皇室事件。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"太皇太后薄氏崩","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"7f465339-2976-424f-8605-f3f952f09b92"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薄氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"薄氏","people_xingming":"薄氏","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f0ee650-db0e-11ef-9622-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_